    "Added at this strength, in the item's unit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se añade con esta concentración, en la unidad del artículo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按此规格换算后，以该项目的单位计入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按此規格換算後，以該項目的單位計入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added drowsiness and next-day grogginess, with more fall and coordination risk. The labels warn about combining with other CNS depressants, opioids included." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Más somnolencia y aturdimiento al día siguiente, con mayor riesgo de caídas y de pérdida de coordinación. Los prospectos advierten sobre combinarlos con otros depresores del SNC, opioides incluidos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会更困倦、次日更昏沉，跌倒和协调性风险也更高。说明书警告不要与包括阿片类在内的其他中枢神经抑制剂合用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "會更睏倦、次日更昏沉，跌倒和協調性風險也更高。說明書警告不要與包括鴉片類在內的其他中樞神經抑制劑併用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additional Info" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Información adicional"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更多信息"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更多資訊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additive CNS and respiratory depression — antihistamines potentiate opioid sedation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Depresión del SNC y respiratoria aditiva — los antihistamínicos potencian la sedación opioide."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中枢和呼吸抑制相加——抗组胺药增强阿片类的镇静作用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中樞和呼吸抑制相加——抗組織胺藥增強鴉片類的鎮靜作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additive CNS and respiratory depression, with a raised risk of vomiting while unresponsive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Depresión del SNC y respiratoria aditiva, con mayor riesgo de vomitar estando inconsciente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中枢与呼吸抑制相加，并且在失去反应时呕吐的风险升高。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中樞與呼吸抑制相加，並且在失去反應時嘔吐的風險升高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additive CNS and respiratory depression." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Depresión del SNC y respiratoria aditiva."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中枢和呼吸抑制相加。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
