    "after 21:00" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "después de las 21:00"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "21:00 之后"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "21:00 之後"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a break or in a new setting, tolerance drops — a dose that felt fine before can stop your breathing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tras un descanso o en un entorno nuevo, la tolerancia baja — una dosis que antes iba bien puede detener tu respiración."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停用一段时间后，或换了环境，耐受会下降——以前没事的剂量可能让你停止呼吸。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停用一段時間後，或換了環境，耐受會下降——以前沒事的劑量可能讓你停止呼吸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a stimulant wears off, fatigue, irritability and low mood are commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando un estimulante se pasa, es común que se reporten fatiga, irritabilidad y ánimo bajo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兴奋剂消退之后，常有人感到疲劳、易怒和情绪低落。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "興奮劑消退之後，常有人感到疲勞、易怒和情緒低落。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After regular use, a seizure or severe confusion on stopping is an emergency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tras un uso regular, una convulsión o una confusión grave al dejarlo es una emergencia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长期规律使用后，停药时出现抽搐或严重意识混乱属于急症。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "長期規律使用後，停藥時出現抽搐或嚴重意識混亂屬於急症。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After regular use, stopping abruptly can be dangerous." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tras un uso regular, dejarlo de golpe puede ser peligroso."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "规律使用后，突然停用可能有危险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "規律使用後，突然停用可能有危險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
