    "As a benzodiazepine wears off, rebound anxiety and restlessness are commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando una benzodiacepina se desvanece, es común que se reporten ansiedad de rebote e inquietud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯二氮䓬类消退时，常有人出现反跳性焦虑和坐立不安。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯二氮平類消退時，常有人出現反跳性焦慮和坐立不安。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As a depressant wears off, feeling shaky, anxious or nauseous is commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando un depresor se desvanece, se reporta a menudo sentir temblores, ansiedad o náuseas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中枢抑制药消退时，常有人感到发抖、焦虑或恶心。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中樞抑制藥消退時，常有人感到發抖、焦慮或噁心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As an opioid fades, increased pain sensitivity, restlessness and mild nausea are commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando un opioide se desvanece, es común que se reporten mayor sensibilidad al dolor, inquietud y náuseas leves."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "阿片类药效消退时，常有人出现痛觉敏感增加、坐立不安和轻度恶心。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鴉片類藥效消退時，常有人出現痛覺敏感增加、坐立不安和輕度噁心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
