    },
    "Avoid greasy, heavy food — it sounds good but often makes nausea worse." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Evita la comida grasosa y pesada — suena bien, pero suele empeorar las náuseas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免油腻、难消化的食物——虽然看着诱人，但常会让恶心更严重。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免油膩、難消化的食物——雖然看著誘人，但常會讓噁心更嚴重。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid hot baths or showers alone — you may not feel temperature accurately." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Evita baños o duchas calientes a solas — puede que no percibas bien la temperatura."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免独自泡热水澡或冲热水澡——你可能无法准确感知温度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免獨自泡熱水澡或沖熱水澡——你可能無法準確感知溫度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid mixing alcohol with metronidazole or certain other antibiotics — they block this same step and can make even a small drink severe." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Evita mezclar alcohol con metronidazol u otros antibióticos concretos — bloquean este mismo paso y pueden hacer que incluso una copa pequeña resulte grave."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免将酒精与甲硝唑或某些其他抗生素同用——它们会阻断同一步骤，可能使哪怕一小杯也变得严重。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免將酒精與甲硝唑或某些其他抗生素同用——它們會阻斷同一步驟，可能使哪怕一小杯也變得嚴重。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid screens and doom-scrolling while you're this impressionable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Evita las pantallas y el scroll compulsivo mientras estés tan impresionable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你还这么容易受影响的时候，避开屏幕和无休止的负面刷屏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你還這麼容易受影響的時候，避開螢幕和無休止的負面刷屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid stairs, sharp objects, and anything requiring fine motor skills." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Evita escaleras, objetos afilados y cualquier cosa que requiera motricidad fina."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免楼梯、尖锐物体和任何需要精细动作的事。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免樓梯、尖銳物體和任何需要精細動作的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
