    "Barcodes are matched offline against the US and French registries the app ships with. Anything else resolves by name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los códigos de barras se cotejan sin conexión con los registros de EE. UU. y Francia incluidos en la app. Todo lo demás se resuelve por nombre."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "条码离线匹配 App 内置的美国和法国药品登记数据；其他情况按名称解析。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "條碼離線比對 App 內建的美國和法國藥品登記資料；其他情況按名稱解析。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Barely builds tolerance; stopping suddenly can make blood pressure rebound hard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apenas genera tolerancia; suspenderlo de golpe puede provocar un fuerte rebote de la presión arterial."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "几乎不产生耐受；突然停用可能让血压强烈反弹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "幾乎不產生耐受；突然停用可能讓血壓強烈反彈。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Barely builds tolerance; stopping suddenly can make heart rate and blood pressure rebound." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apenas genera tolerancia; suspenderlo de golpe puede hacer que la frecuencia cardíaca y la presión arterial reboten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "几乎不产生耐受；突然停用可能让心率和血压反弹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "幾乎不產生耐受；突然停用可能讓心率和血壓反彈。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Based on %lld of %lld entries with dose data" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
