            "value" : "合併重複記錄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Combine repeated entries for the same substance into one curve. When off, each entry has its own curve." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Combina los registros repetidos de la misma sustancia en una sola curva. Si está desactivado, cada registro tiene su propia curva."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将同一物质的重复记录合并为一条曲线。关闭时，每条记录各有一条曲线。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將同一物質的重複記錄合併為一條曲線。關閉時，每筆記錄各有一條曲線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Combined depression peaks around %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La depresión combinada del SNC alcanza el pico hacia %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "合并抑制作用约在 %@ 达到峰值"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "合併抑制作用約在 %@ 達到峰值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Combined QTc prolongation risk — monitor cardiac rhythm." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riesgo combinado de prolongación del QTc — vigila el ritmo cardíaco."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "联合 QTc 延长的风险——监测心律。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聯合 QTc 延長的風險——監測心律。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Combined respiratory depression — the leading cause of overdose death." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Depresión respiratoria combinada — la principal causa de muerte por sobredosis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "联合呼吸抑制——过量致死的首要原因。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聯合呼吸抑制——過量致死的首要原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Combined respiratory depression with no ceiling — barbiturates deepen an opioid's suppression of breathing until it stops." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Depresión respiratoria combinada sin techo — los barbitúricos profundizan la supresión de la respiración de un opioide hasta que se detiene."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "呼吸抑制相加且没有封顶——巴比妥类会不断加深阿片类对呼吸的抑制，直到呼吸停止。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "呼吸抑制相加且沒有封頂——巴比妥類會不斷加深鴉片類對呼吸的抑制，直到呼吸停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
