            "value" : "dose.wiki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dosed in low milligrams — use a milligram scale (0.001 g). Can't be measured by eye or kitchen scale." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se dosifica en pocos miligramos — usa una balanza de miligramos (0.001 g). No se puede medir a ojo ni con una balanza de cocina."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量仅几毫克，请用毫克秤（0.001 g）。无法目测或用厨房秤称量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量僅幾毫克，請用毫克秤（0.001 g）。無法目測或用廚房秤稱量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses add with no plateau, and the gap between a sedating dose and a fatal one is narrow to begin with." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las dosis se suman sin meseta, y la distancia entre una dosis sedante y una mortal ya es estrecha de por sí."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量相加且不会趋于平缓，而镇静剂量与致死剂量之间的差距本就很窄。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量相加且不會趨於平緩，而鎮靜劑量與致死劑量之間的差距本就很窄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses are milligrams of THC. Flower needed ≈ desired THC ÷ the strain's %THC (e.g. 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g). Smoking loses 50–80% to combustion, so real flower amounts run higher." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las dosis son miligramos de THC. Flor necesaria ≈ THC deseado ÷ el %THC de la variedad (p. ej. 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g). Al fumar se pierde un 50–80% en la combustión, así que las cantidades reales de flor son mayores."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量是 THC 的毫克数。所需花量 ≈ 目标 THC ÷ 品系的 THC 含量百分比（例如 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g）。吸食会因燃烧损失 50–80%，因此实际所需花量更高。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量是 THC 的毫克數。所需花量 ≈ 目標 THC ÷ 品系的 THC 含量百分比（例如 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g）。吸食會因燃燒損失 50–80%，因此實際所需花量更高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses in other units aren't counted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las dosis en otras unidades no se cuentan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其他单位的剂量不计入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其他單位的劑量不計入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses stay the substance's own — only the duration curve changes." : {
      "comment" : "Branded formulations: clarifies the dose ladder is unaffected",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las dosis siguen siendo las de la propia sustancia — solo cambia la curva de duración."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量仍为该物质本身的剂量——只有作用时长曲线会改变。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量仍為該物質本身的劑量——只有作用時長曲線會改變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dosing Defaults" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Valores predeterminados de dosificación"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量默认值"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量預設值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dosing shown reflects published or community protocols, not medical advice. Peptides are injected from reconstituted powder — handle and store as noted below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La dosificación mostrada refleja protocolos publicados o de la comunidad; no es consejo médico. Los péptidos se inyectan a partir de polvo reconstituido — manipúlalos y guárdalos como se indica abajo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此处所示剂量反映的是已发表或社区的方案，不是医疗建议。肽类由复溶的粉末注射——请按下文说明处理和储存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此處所示劑量反映的是已發表或社群的方案，不是醫療建議。胜肽由復溶的粉末注射——請按下文說明處理和儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
