    },
    "Each card is that substance's own contribution. Mechanisms are shared, so your overall level (the chart above, or By mechanism) can be higher." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada tarjeta es la contribución propia de esa sustancia. Los mecanismos son compartidos, así que tu nivel general (el gráfico de arriba, o Por mecanismo) puede ser mayor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每张卡片是该物质自身的贡献。机制是共享的，所以你的整体水平（上方图表或“按机制”）可能更高。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每張卡片是該物質自身的貢獻。機制是共享的，所以你的整體水平（上方圖表或「按機制」）可能更高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each comparison groups your rated days by one factor at a time and counts how often you rated the dose \"about right\" or more. These describe your entries; they don't show that a substance, dose, or timing caused a difference." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada comparación agrupa tus días valorados según un factor a la vez y cuenta con qué frecuencia valoraste la dosis \"como siempre\" o más. Describen tus registros; no demuestran que una sustancia, dosis u horario causara una diferencia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每组对照只按一个因素划分你评过分的日子，统计其中有多少次剂量被评为“和平时差不多”或更强。这些只是在描述你的记录；它们并不说明是某种物质、剂量或时间造成了差异。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每組對照只按一個因素劃分你評過分的日子，統計其中有多少次劑量被評為「和平時差不多」或更強。這些只是在描述你的記錄；它們並不說明是某種物質、劑量或時間造成了差異。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each entry appears on the timeline, showing overlaps and when the model estimates the effects will fade." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada registro aparece en la línea de tiempo, mostrando las superposiciones y cuándo estima el modelo que se desvanecerán los efectos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条记录都会显示在时间线上，呈现重叠情况和模型估计的效应消退时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每筆記錄都會顯示在時間線上，呈現重疊情況和模型估計的效應消退時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each ester's own release, before they sum to the serum estimate above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La liberación propia de cada éster, antes de sumarse en la estimación sérica de arriba."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每种酯各自的释放，在汇总为上方的血清估计值之前。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每種酯各自的釋放，在彙總為上方的血清估計值之前。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each line as a share of its own peak" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada línea como proporción de su propio pico"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条线按自身峰值的比例显示"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每條線按自身峰值的比例顯示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each row lists what that source supplied here. Links open the source's own page — always verify against the original." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada fila indica lo que esa fuente aportó aquí. Los enlaces abren la página de la propia fuente — verifica siempre con el original."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一行列出该来源在此提供的内容。链接会打开来源自身的页面——请始终对照原始资料核实。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一行列出該來源在此提供的內容。連結會開啟來源自身的頁面——請始終對照原始資料核實。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each substance page lists which of these supplied each field." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada página de sustancia indica cuál de estas aportó cada campo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个物质页面都会列出各个字段由其中哪个来源提供。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個物質頁面都會列出各個欄位由其中哪個來源提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each substance page names the source of each field. Text from PsychonautWiki and FreeOD Wiki is used under CC BY-SA 4.0, edited and merged with other sources, and remains available under that license." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada página de sustancia nombra la fuente de cada campo. El texto de PsychonautWiki y FreeOD Wiki se usa bajo CC BY-SA 4.0, editado y combinado con otras fuentes, y sigue disponible bajo esa licencia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个物质页面都会标明每个字段的来源。来自 PsychonautWiki 和 FreeOD Wiki 的文本依 CC BY-SA 4.0 使用，经编辑并与其他来源合并，并继续依该许可提供。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個物質頁面都會標明每個欄位的來源。來自 PsychonautWiki 和 FreeOD Wiki 的文字依 CC BY-SA 4.0 使用，經編輯並與其他來源合併，並繼續依該授權提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat light foods: fruit, toast, soup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Come alimentos ligeros: fruta, tostadas, sopa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃点清淡的：水果、吐司、汤。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃點清淡的：水果、吐司、湯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something balanced." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Come algo equilibrado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃点营养均衡的东西。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃點營養均衡的東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something grounding — warm food, fruit, or anything that sounds appealing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Come algo que te asiente — comida caliente, fruta o cualquier cosa que te resulte apetitosa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些让人安定的东西——温热的食物、水果或任何想吃的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些讓人安定的東西——溫熱的食物、水果或任何想吃的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something nutritious — protein, carbs, and fruit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Come algo nutritivo — proteína, carbohidratos y fruta"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些营养食物——蛋白质、碳水化合物和水果"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些營養食物——蛋白質、碳水化合物和水果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something with salt, protein, and carbs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Come algo con sal, proteína y carbohidratos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃点含盐、蛋白质和碳水的东西。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃點含鹽、蛋白質和碳水的東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something, even without hunger. Protein and complex carbs are the usual suggestion." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Come algo, aunque no tengas hambre. La sugerencia habitual es proteína y carbohidratos complejos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使不饿也吃点东西。通常建议蛋白质和复合碳水。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使不餓也吃點東西。通常建議蛋白質和複合碳水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EC50 %@ nM" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EC50 %@ nM"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EC50 %@ nM"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EC50 %@ nM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EDDP has no opioid activity — it's the primary urinary marker for methadone compliance monitoring, not a contributor to the drug's effect or duration." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El EDDP no tiene actividad opioide — es el principal marcador urinario para el control del cumplimiento con metadona, no contribuye al efecto ni a la duración del fármaco."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EDDP 无阿片活性——它是美沙酮依从性监测的主要尿液标志物，不参与药物效应或持续时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EDDP 無鴉片活性——它是美沙酮依從性監測的主要尿液標誌物，不參與藥物效應或持續時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edibles also come on slowly — usually 30 minutes to 2 hours — and last much longer, often 6–10 hours. That slow start is the redose trap: more taken before the first dose has arrived stacks into a far stronger, longer experience than intended." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los comestibles también tardan en subir — normalmente de 30 minutos a 2 horas — y duran mucho más, a menudo 6–10 horas. Ese inicio lento es la trampa de la redosis: lo que se toma de más antes de que llegue la primera dosis se acumula en una experiencia mucho más fuerte y larga de lo previsto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "食用型起效也慢——通常要 30 分钟到 2 小时——而且持续得久得多，常常 6–10 小时。这种慢起效正是补服的陷阱：在第一剂还没上来之前再吃，叠起来的体验会比预想的强得多、久得多。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "食用型起效也慢——通常要 30 分鐘到 2 小時——而且持續得久得多，常常 6–10 小時。這種慢起效正是補服的陷阱：在第一劑還沒上來之前再吃，疊起來的體驗會比預想的強得多、久得多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Editar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "编辑"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "編輯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit concentration" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Editar concentración"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "编辑浓度"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "編輯濃度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit concentrations…" : {
