            "value" : "收藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Favorite a substance or record an entry on your iPhone to find it here." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Marca una sustancia como favorita o añade un registro en tu iPhone para encontrarla aquí."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 iPhone 上收藏物质或添加记录，即可在这里找到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 iPhone 上收藏物質或新增記錄，即可在這裡找到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Favorites" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Favoritos"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收藏"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Favorites, colors, units, and the substances you added." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Favoritos, colores, unidades y las sustancias que añadiste."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收藏、颜色、单位和你添加的物质。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收藏、顏色、單位和你新增的物質。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sensación"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感受"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感受"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling and energy curves based on the entries this model supports." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Curvas de sensación y energía basadas en los registros que este modelo admite."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据模型支持的记录估计感受与精力曲线。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根據模型支援的記錄估計感受與精力曲線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling and energy estimated from this session" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sensación y energía estimadas a partir de esta sesión"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据本场记录估计的感受与精力"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根據本場記錄估計的感受與精力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling bad is a listed effect of this class. It still deserves attention — Piru can't tell whether a symptom is harmless." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sentirse mal es un efecto listado de esta clase. Aun así merece atención — Piru no puede saber si un síntoma es inofensivo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感觉糟糕是这一类列出的效应。它仍然值得重视——Piru 无法判断一个症状是否无害。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感覺糟糕是這一類列出的效應。它仍然值得重視——Piru 無法判斷一個症狀是否無害。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling emotionally open, contemplative, or just tired afterwards is commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se reporta a menudo sentir apertura emocional, ganas de reflexionar o simplemente cansancio después."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事后常有人感到情感开放、若有所思，或只是疲惫。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事後常有人感到情感開放、若有所思，或只是疲憊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling foggy or unreal for a while afterwards is commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se reporta a menudo sentir aturdimiento o irrealidad durante un rato después."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事后常有人会有一段时间感觉昏沉或不真实。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事後常有人會有一段時間感覺昏沉或不真實。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling foggy, lethargic or mildly irritable afterwards is commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se reporta a menudo sentir aturdimiento, letargo o algo de irritabilidad después."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事后常有人感觉昏沉、倦怠或轻微易怒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事後常有人感覺昏沉、倦怠或輕微易怒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling hot and cold is commonly reported. A high temperature that rest and cooling don't bring down is an emergency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se reporta a menudo sentir calor y frío. Una temperatura alta que no baja con reposo y enfriamiento es una emergencia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常有人忽冷忽热。休息和降温都压不下去的高热属于急症。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常有人忽冷忽熱。休息和降溫都壓不下去的高熱屬於急症。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling less sedated does not establish that memory or coordination are unimpaired — tolerance to sedation builds faster than tolerance to impairment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sentir menos sedación no demuestra que la memoria o la coordinación estén intactas — la tolerancia a la sedación se desarrolla más rápido que la tolerancia al deterioro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感觉没那么困，并不能证明记忆或协调性没有受损——对镇静的耐受比对功能受损的耐受形成得更快。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感覺沒那麼睏，並不能證明記憶或協調性沒有受損——對鎮靜的耐受比對功能受損的耐受形成得更快。"
