    "How long after taking it the level in your blood is highest — roughly when effects peak." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuánto tarda, tras tomarlo, en alcanzar el nivel máximo en sangre — aproximadamente cuando los efectos llegan al pico."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用药后多久血液中的浓度达到最高——大致也是效果最强的时刻。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用藥後多久血液中的濃度達到最高——大致也是效果最強的時刻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Long It Stays" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuánto permanece"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在体内停留多久"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在體內停留多久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long that lasts varies between people, and the kinetics in humans aren't well measured." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuánto dura varía entre personas, y la cinética en humanos no está bien medida."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "持续多久因人而异，人体中的动力学也没有被很好地测量过。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "持續多久因人而異，人體中的動力學也沒有被很好地測量過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many substances a session needs before it splits into lanes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuántas sustancias necesita una sesión antes de dividirse en carriles."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个场次需要多少种物质才会拆分为泳道。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一個場次需要多少種物質才會拆分為泳道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Modeled Tolerance Works" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo funciona la tolerancia modelada"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型推算耐受的原理"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型推算耐受的原理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much detail?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Cuánto detalle?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "想看多少细节？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "想看多少細節？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much is estimated to be in your body, using only data from this session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuánto se estima que hay en tu cuerpo, usando solo datos de esta sesión."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅用本场次的数据估算出的体内存量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅用本場次的資料估算出的體內存量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of a dose actually reaches your bloodstream. Swallowing a drug usually delivers less than injecting it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qué parte de una dosis llega realmente a tu sangre. Tragar un fármaco suele aportar menos que inyectarlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次用药中真正进入血液的比例。口服通常比注射进入血液的量更少。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次用藥中真正進入血液的比例。口服通常比注射進入血液的量更少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of a dose becomes its active form is partly genetic — the same dose can produce noticeably more effect in some people than in others." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qué parte de una dosis se convierte en su forma activa es en parte genético — la misma dosis puede producir notablemente más efecto en unas personas que en otras."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一剂中有多少转化为活性形式部分取决于基因。同样的剂量在某些人身上效应明显更强。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一劑中有多少轉化為活性形式部分取決於基因。同樣的劑量在某些人身上效應明顯更強。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much pharmacology is shown by default on substance pages and in the Tolerance tool." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuánta farmacología se muestra por defecto en las páginas de sustancias y en la herramienta Tolerancia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "物质页面和耐受工具默认显示多少药理学内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "物質頁面和耐受工具預設顯示多少藥理學內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strong it is compared to %@ hasn't been established." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su potencia en comparación con %@ no se ha establecido."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其相对于 %@ 的强度尚无定论。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其相對於 %@ 的強度尚無定論。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strong that is tracks how much and how often you've been using." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su intensidad depende de cuánto y con qué frecuencia has estado tomando."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其强度取决于你用了多少、多频繁。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其強度取決於你用了多少、多頻繁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the drug acts in the body — which receptors and transporters it targets, and what it does at each (switches them on, blocks them, and so on). The dots show how strongly it acts at each target." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo actúa el fármaco en el cuerpo — a qué receptores y transportadores se dirige, y qué hace en cada uno (los activa, los bloquea, etc.). Los puntos muestran con qué fuerza actúa en cada diana."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "药物在体内如何起作用——它作用于哪些受体和转运体，以及在每个靶点上做什么（激活、阻断等）。圆点表示它在各靶点上的作用强度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "藥物在體內如何起作用——它作用於哪些受體和轉運體，以及在每個靶點上做什麼（活化、阻斷等）。圓點表示它在各靶點上的作用強度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How this is calculated" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo se calcula"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如何计算"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如何計算"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How this works" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo funciona"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
