          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "運作原理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How tolerance works" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo funciona la tolerancia"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "耐受是如何形成的"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "耐受是如何形成的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How was it, overall?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Cómo fue, en general?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整体感觉如何？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整體感覺如何？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How widely the drug spreads from blood into the rest of the body. A bigger number means it soaks into tissues rather than staying in the blood." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuánto se distribuye el fármaco desde la sangre al resto del cuerpo. Un número mayor significa que se impregna en los tejidos en vez de quedarse en la sangre."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "药物从血液扩散到全身其他部位的广泛程度。数值越大，表示它越多渗入组织而非停留在血液中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "藥物從血液擴散到全身其他部位的廣泛程度。數值越大，表示它越多滲入組織而非停留在血液中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How you feel depends on what you took, how much, and your own body." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo te sientes depende de lo que tomaste, cuánto, y de tu propio cuerpo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的感受取决于你用了什么、用了多少，以及你自己的身体。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的感受取決於你用了什麼、用了多少，以及你自己的身體。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How your body breaks the drug down — which liver enzymes do the work, what byproducts (metabolites) form, and whether those are still active. The percentage is each enzyme's rough share of clearance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo tu cuerpo descompone el fármaco — qué enzimas hepáticas hacen el trabajo, qué subproductos (metabolitos) se forman y si siguen siendo activos. El porcentaje es la parte aproximada de cada enzima en la eliminación."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身体如何分解药物——由哪些肝酶完成、生成哪些副产物（代谢物），以及这些代谢物是否仍具活性。百分比是每种酶在清除中的大致占比。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身體如何分解藥物——由哪些肝酶完成、生成哪些副產物（代謝物），以及這些代謝物是否仍具活性。百分比是每種酶在清除中的大致占比。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
