    "Identify" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Identificar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "识别"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "識別"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identify a Box" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Identificar una caja"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "识别药盒"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "識別藥盒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If a dose isn't logged, ask again after these intervals. Applies to every med. A med can override or opt out in its own settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si una dosis no se registra, vuelve a preguntar tras estos intervalos. Se aplica a todos los medicamentos. Cada medicamento puede cambiarlo o desactivarlo en sus propios ajustes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果一剂还未记录，就按这些间隔再次提醒。适用于所有用药。每种用药都可以在自己的设置中更改或关闭。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果一劑還未記錄，就按這些間隔再次提醒。適用於所有用藥。每種用藥都可以在自己的設定中更改或關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If nauseous, small sips of water and lying on your side help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si tienes náuseas, ayudan los sorbos pequeños de agua y acostarte de lado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到恶心时，小口喝水并侧卧有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到噁心時，小口喝水並側臥有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If someone is hard to wake or breathing slowly, call emergency services." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si alguien no despierta con facilidad o respira despacio, llama a emergencias."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有人难以叫醒或呼吸缓慢，请呼叫急救。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有人難以叫醒或呼吸緩慢，請呼叫急救。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If someone is hard to wake, breathing slowly, or has blue lips, call emergency services. Give naloxone if you have it, following its instructions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si alguien no despierta con facilidad, respira despacio o tiene los labios azules, llama a emergencias. Administra naloxona si la tienes, siguiendo sus instrucciones."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有人难以叫醒、呼吸缓慢或嘴唇发紫，请呼叫急救。如果手边有纳洛酮，请按其说明使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有人難以叫醒、呼吸緩慢或嘴唇發紫，請呼叫急救。如果手邊有納洛酮，請按其說明使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If someone is hard to wake, breathing slowly, or vomiting while drowsy, put them on their side and call emergency services." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si alguien no despierta con facilidad, respira despacio o vomita estando somnoliento, ponlo de lado y llama a emergencias."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有人难以叫醒、呼吸缓慢，或在昏沉中呕吐，请让其侧卧并呼叫急救。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有人難以叫醒、呼吸緩慢，或在昏沉中嘔吐，請讓其側臥並呼叫急救。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If someone is hard to wake, breathing slowly, overheating or having a seizure, call emergency services." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si alguien no despierta con facilidad, respira despacio, se está sobrecalentando o tiene una convulsión, llama a emergencias."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有人难以唤醒、呼吸缓慢、体温过高或癫痫发作，请呼叫急救。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有人難以喚醒、呼吸緩慢、體溫過高或癲癇發作，請呼叫急救。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the experience was intense: the acute effects of this class are time-limited, and company helps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si la experiencia fue intensa: los efectos agudos de esta clase tienen un límite de tiempo, y la compañía ayuda."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果体验很强烈：这一类的急性效应是有时限的，有人陪伴会有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果體驗很強烈：這一類的急性效應是有時限的，有人陪伴會有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this is frequent for you, consider talking to a professional about alternatives." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si esto te ocurre con frecuencia, considera hablar con un profesional sobre alternativas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果这对你来说很常见，可以考虑和专业人士聊聊替代方案。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果這對你來說很常見，可以考慮和專業人士聊聊替代方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel anxious, slow your breathing. Anxiety is a listed effect of this class." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si sientes ansiedad, respira más despacio. La ansiedad es un efecto descrito de esta clase."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到焦虑，放慢呼吸。焦虑是这一类列出的效应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到焦慮，放慢呼吸。焦慮是這一類列出的效應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel nauseous, lie on your side." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si tienes náuseas, acuéstate de lado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到恶心，请侧卧。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到噁心，請側臥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel spacey, grounding exercises: name 5 things you can see, 4 you can touch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si te sientes en las nubes, ejercicios de anclaje: nombra 5 cosas que puedas ver, 4 que puedas tocar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感觉飘忽，做稳定练习：说出 5 件你能看见的、4 件能触摸的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感覺飄忽，做穩定練習：說出 5 件你能看見的、4 件能觸摸的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel unwell, don't hesitate to call for help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si te sientes mal, no dudes en pedir ayuda."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到不适，不要犹豫，寻求帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到不適，不要猶豫，尋求協助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you have been drinking heavily and daily for weeks, stopping abruptly can be dangerous — seizures and delirium tremens peak 2–4 days after the last drink." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si has bebido mucho y a diario durante semanas, dejarlo de golpe puede ser peligroso — las convulsiones y el delirium tremens alcanzan su pico 2–4 días después de la última copa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你已经连续数周每日大量饮酒，突然停酒可能有危险——癫痫发作和震颤谵妄在最后一次饮酒后 2–4 天达到高峰。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你已經連續數週每日大量飲酒，突然停酒可能有危險——癲癇發作和震顫譫妄在最後一次飲酒後 2–4 天達到高峰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you lose this passphrase, the backup can't be recovered. There is no reset." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si pierdes esta frase de contraseña, la copia de seguridad no se puede recuperar. No hay forma de restablecerla."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你丢失此口令，备份将无法恢复。无法重置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你遺失此通行碼，備份將無法還原。無法重設。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
