    },
    "It estimates a level. It never suggests a dose or a target. Your lab results fit the model to your measurements, which doesn't establish accuracy between them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estima un nivel. Nunca sugiere una dosis ni un objetivo. Tus resultados de laboratorio ajustan el modelo a tus mediciones, lo que no establece precisión entre ellas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它估计一个水平，从不建议剂量或目标。你的化验结果让模型贴合你的测量值，但这并不能证明各次测量之间的准确性。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它估計一個水平，從不建議劑量或目標。你的化驗結果讓模型貼合你的測量值，但這並不能證明各次測量之間的準確性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It estimates a level. It never suggests a dose or a target. Your lab results fit the model to your measurements, which doesn't establish accuracy between them. The reference lines are your own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estima un nivel. Nunca sugiere una dosis ni un objetivo. Tus resultados de laboratorio ajustan el modelo a tus mediciones, lo que no establece precisión entre ellas. Las líneas de referencia son tuyas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它估计一个水平，从不建议剂量或目标。你的化验结果让模型贴合你的测量值，但这并不能证明各次测量之间的准确性。参考线是你自己的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它估計一個水平，從不建議劑量或目標。你的化驗結果讓模型貼合你的測量值，但這並不能證明各次測量之間的準確性。參考線是你自己的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's been a long session. Your body and brain need sleep to recover. Try to wind down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ha sido una sesión larga. Tu cuerpo y tu cerebro necesitan dormir para recuperarse. Intenta bajar el ritmo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这一场已经持续了很长时间。你的身体和大脑需要睡眠来恢复。试着放松一下。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這一場已經持續了很長時間。你的身體和大腦需要睡眠來恢復。試著放鬆一下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
