    "Keep substances in a fixed order. When off, recording an entry moves its substance to the front." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantiene las sustancias en un orden fijo. Si está desactivado, añadir un registro mueve su sustancia al principio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持物质顺序固定。关闭后，添加记录会将对应物质移到最前。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持物質順序固定。關閉後，新增記錄會將對應物質移到最前。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep tabs on what you have on hand and get a heads-up when it runs low." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Controla lo que tienes a mano y recibe un aviso cuando se esté acabando."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "随时掌握你的现有量，库存不足时提醒你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隨時掌握你的現有量，庫存不足時提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep track of what you take and when — one tap to set up gentle reminders. Prescriptions, supplements, vitamins: anything on a schedule." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lleva el control de qué tomas y cuándo — un toque para configurar recordatorios discretos. Recetas, suplementos, vitaminas: cualquier cosa con horario."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录你服用了什么、何时服用——轻点一下即可设置温和的提醒。处方药、补剂、维生素：任何按计划服用的东西。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記錄你服用了什麼、何時服用——點一下即可設定溫和的提醒。處方藥、補劑、維生素：任何按計劃服用的東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
