    "May reduce hormonal birth-control efficacy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede reducir la eficacia de los anticonceptivos hormonales"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可能降低激素类避孕药的效果"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可能降低激素類避孕藥的效果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mCPP acts on serotonin in a different way than trazodone — it tends to feel activating or anxious rather than sedating, which is part of why trazodone's later hours can feel unlike its calm onset." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La mCPP actúa sobre la serotonina de una forma distinta a la trazodona — tiende a sentirse activadora o ansiógena en lugar de sedante, lo que explica en parte por qué las últimas horas de la trazodona pueden sentirse distintas de su inicio tranquilo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mCPP 以不同于曲唑酮的方式作用于血清素——它倾向于产生激活感或焦虑感，而非镇静，这是曲唑酮后半段感受可能与平静的起效阶段不同的部分原因。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mCPP 以不同於曲唑酮的方式作用於血清素——它傾向於產生亢奮感或焦慮感，而非鎮靜，這是曲唑酮後半段感受可能與平靜的起效階段不同的部分原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDA is an active drug of its own — more amphetamine-like and more hallucinogenic than MDMA, and longer-lived — so the later hours can feel qualitatively different from the peak." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La MDA es una sustancia activa por sí misma — más anfetamínica y más alucinógena que la MDMA, y de mayor duración — así que las últimas horas pueden sentirse cualitativamente distintas del pico."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDA 本身就是一种活性药物——比 MDMA 更像苯丙胺、致幻性更强，也更持久——因此后段时间的体验在性质上会与高峰期不同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDA 本身就是一種活性藥物——比 MDMA 更像安非他命、致幻性更強，也更持久——因此後段時間的體驗在性質上會與高峰期不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDMA" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDMA releases serotonin in bulk and lithium adds to it, so serotonin syndrome is the main risk. Seizures are reported for lithium with classic psychedelics; MDMA has not been looked at the same way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La MDMA libera serotonina en masa y el litio se suma a ello, así que el síndrome serotoninérgico es el riesgo principal. Se reportan convulsiones con litio y psicodélicos clásicos; la MDMA no se ha estudiado de la misma manera."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA 会大量释放血清素，锂在此之上再加一份，因此主要风险是血清素综合征。锂与经典迷幻剂合用有癫痫发作的报告；MDMA 没有被同样地研究过。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA 會大量釋放血清素，鋰在此之上再加一份，因此主要風險是血清素症候群。鋰與經典迷幻劑合用有癲癇發作的報告；MDMA 沒有被同樣地研究過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measure" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Medir"
          }
        },
