    "of %lld days" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "de %lld días"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "共 %lld 天"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "共 %lld 天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Of 62 reports of this combination, 47% described a seizure and 39% involved medical attention — against none of 34 reports for lamotrigine. Self-reported, so the rate is not a measured one, but no other pairing shows a signal like it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De 62 reportes de esta combinación, el 47% describió una convulsión y el 39% implicó atención médica — frente a ninguno de los 34 reportes de lamotrigina. Son autorreportes, así que la tasa no es una medida real, pero ninguna otra combinación muestra una señal así."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在这一组合的62份报告中，47% 描述了癫痫发作，39% 涉及就医——而拉莫三嗪的34份报告中一例也没有。这些都是自我报告，所以这个比例并非实测值，但没有别的组合出现过这样的信号。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在這一組合的62份報告中，47% 描述了癲癇發作，39% 涉及就醫——而拉莫三嗪的34份報告中一例也沒有。這些都是自我報告，所以這個比例並非實測值，但沒有別的組合出現過這樣的訊號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "of days" : {
      "localizations" : {
