    "Piru" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru and PsychonautWiki files are plain JSON. Imports add to your journal (duplicates skipped). Encrypted restores can merge or replace. Inventory is included in Piru and encrypted backups, but not PsychonautWiki files." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los archivos de Piru y PsychonautWiki son JSON sin cifrar. Las importaciones se añaden a tu diario (los duplicados se omiten). Las restauraciones cifradas pueden fusionar o reemplazar. El inventario se incluye en las copias de Piru y en las cifradas, pero no en los archivos de PsychonautWiki."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 和 PsychonautWiki 文件是纯 JSON。导入会添加到你的日记（重复项跳过）。加密备份可合并或替换。库存包含在 Piru 和加密备份中，但不含 PsychonautWiki 文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 和 PsychonautWiki 檔案是純 JSON。匯入會新增到你的日記（重複項略過）。加密備份可合併或取代。庫存包含在 Piru 和加密備份中，但不含 PsychonautWiki 檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru asks the system once. You choose exactly what it sends below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru se lo pide al sistema una sola vez. Abajo eliges exactamente qué envía."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 只向系统请求一次。要发送哪些内容，由你在下方逐项决定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 只向系統請求一次。要傳送哪些內容，由你在下方逐項決定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru backup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copia de seguridad de Piru"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 备份"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 備份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru Backup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copia de seguridad de Piru"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 备份"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 備份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru can keep it simple or go deep into the pharmacology. Change this anytime in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru puede mantenerlo simple o profundizar en la farmacología. Cámbialo cuando quieras en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 可以保持简洁，也可以深入药理。随时可在设置中更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 可以保持簡潔，也可以深入藥理。隨時可在設定中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru can't assess heart symptoms. With chest pain, shortness of breath or fainting, call emergency services." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru no puede evaluar síntomas cardíacos. Con dolor en el pecho, dificultad para respirar o desmayos, llama a los servicios de emergencia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 无法评估心脏症状。如伴有胸痛、呼吸急促或晕厥，请呼叫急救。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 無法評估心臟症狀。如伴有胸痛、呼吸急促或暈厥，請呼叫急救。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru can't assess how you are. The people at the numbers below can." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru no puede evaluar cómo estás. Las personas de los números de abajo sí."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 无法评估你的状况。下面这些号码另一端的人可以。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 無法評估你的狀況。下面這些號碼另一端的人可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru can't tell temporary confusion from a serious symptom. Confusion that deepens, or comes with a high temperature, is a reason to get help now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru no puede distinguir una confusión pasajera de un síntoma grave. Una confusión que se agrava, o que viene con fiebre alta, es motivo para buscar ayuda ahora."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 无法判断意识混乱是一时的不适还是严重症状。不断加重的意识混乱，或伴随高热时，应当立刻求助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 無法判斷意識混亂是一時的不適還是嚴重症狀。不斷加重的意識混亂，或伴隨高燒時，應當立刻求助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru couldn't open your journal this time, so it's running with temporary storage. **Nothing has been deleted** — your doses and sessions are safe on this device and a future update will restore them automatically.\n\nSending the logs helps us ship that fix faster. They describe the storage problem only — never your dose data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru no pudo abrir tu diario esta vez, así que funciona con almacenamiento temporal. **No se ha eliminado nada** — tus dosis y sesiones están a salvo en este dispositivo y una futura actualización las restaurará automáticamente.\n\nEnviar los registros nos ayuda a publicar esa corrección antes. Solo describen el problema de almacenamiento — nunca tus datos de dosis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 这次未能打开你的日记，目前正以临时存储运行。**没有任何数据被删除**——你的剂量和场次仍安全保存在这台设备上，未来的更新会自动恢复它们。\n\n发送日志能帮助我们更快推出修复。日志只描述存储问题本身——绝不包含你的剂量数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 這次未能開啟你的日記，目前正以暫時儲存空間執行。**沒有任何資料被刪除**——你的劑量和場次仍安全保存在這部裝置上，未來的更新會自動還原它們。\n\n傳送記錄檔能幫助我們更快推出修正。記錄檔只描述儲存問題本身——絕不包含你的劑量資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru does not monitor emergencies. If someone is in danger, call your local emergency number." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru no monitoriza emergencias. Si alguien está en peligro, llama a tu número de emergencias local."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 不会监测紧急情况。如果有人处于危险之中，请拨打当地的急救电话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 不會監測緊急情況。如果有人處於危險之中，請撥打當地的急救電話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru doesn't establish a safe interval for adding medicines or supplements. MAOIs are the documented danger with this class." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru no establece un intervalo seguro para añadir medicamentos o suplementos. Los IMAO son el peligro documentado con esta clase."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 无法给出加用药物或补充剂的安全间隔。对这一类来说，有文献记录的危险是 MAOI。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 無法給出加用藥物或補充劑的安全間隔。對這一類來說，有文獻記錄的危險是 MAOI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru doesn't measure any of this. It describes what sources report for the class." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru no mide nada de esto. Describe lo que las fuentes reportan para la clase."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 并不测量其中任何一项。它描述的是各来源对这一类的报告。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 並不測量其中任何一項。它描述的是各來源對這一類的報告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru doesn't measure any of this. It describes what sources report." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru no mide nada de esto. Describe lo que reportan las fuentes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 并不测量其中任何一项。它描述的是各来源的报告。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 並不測量其中任何一項。它描述的是各來源的報告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru doesn't model a timeline for %@ %@. The session shows when each dose was taken, not how long it lasts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Piru doesn't model a timeline for %1$@ %2$@. The session shows when each dose was taken, not how long it lasts."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru no modela una línea de tiempo para %@ %@. La sesión muestra cuándo se tomó cada dosis, no cuánto dura."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 无法为 %2$@ 的 %1$@ 绘制时间线。这个场次只显示每次用药的时间，而非其持续时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 無法為 %2$@ 的 %1$@ 繪製時間線。這個場次只顯示每次用藥的時間，而非其持續時長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru doesn't model a timeline for these forms — the session shows when each dose was taken, not how long it lasts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru no modela una línea de tiempo para estas formas — la sesión muestra cuándo se tomó cada dosis, no cuánto dura."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 无法为这些剂型绘制时间线——这个场次只显示每次用药的时间，而非其持续时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 無法為這些劑型繪製時間線——這個場次只顯示每次用藥的時間，而非其持續時長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru has moved" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru se ha mudado"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 搬家了"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 搬家了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru is a personal record and a general reference, provided as is and without warranty of any kind. It is not medical advice and not a medical device, and it is not for diagnosis, treatment, dosing decisions or emergencies." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru es un registro personal y una referencia general, que se ofrece tal cual y sin garantía de ningún tipo. No es consejo médico ni un dispositivo médico, y no sirve para diagnóstico, tratamiento, decisiones de dosificación ni emergencias."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 是一份个人记录和一份通用参考，按原样提供，不附带任何形式的保证。它不是医疗建议，也不是医疗器械，不用于诊断、治疗、剂量决策或紧急情况。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 是一份個人紀錄和一份通用參考，按原樣提供，不附帶任何形式的保證。它不是醫療建議，也不是醫療器材，不用於診斷、治療、劑量決策或緊急情況。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru now lives in a new app. Install it on this device and the first time you open it, your journal, meds and settings come across on their own. Nothing here is deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru ahora vive en una app nueva. Instálala en este dispositivo y, la primera vez que la abras, tu diario, tus medicamentos y tus ajustes pasarán solos. Nada de lo que hay aquí se elimina."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 现在是一个新的 App。在这台设备上安装它，第一次打开时，你的日记、用药和设置会自动搬过去。这里的内容不会被删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 現在是一個新的 App。在這台裝置上安裝它，第一次打開時，你的日記、用藥和設定會自動搬過去。這裡的內容不會被刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru shows the highest-priority source you've enabled that has this data — and you choose the order." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru muestra la fuente de mayor prioridad que hayas activado y que tenga este dato — y el orden lo eliges tú."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 会显示你已启用的、拥有该数据的最高优先级来源——顺序由你决定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 會顯示你已啟用的、擁有該資料的最高優先順序來源——順序由你決定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru, PsychonautWiki, or an encrypted backup" : {
