    "Promote wakefulness without the dopaminergic surge of a classical stimulant. Mechanism is still argued over; the effect is alertness without much euphoria." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Promueven la vigilia sin la descarga dopaminérgica de un estimulante clásico. El mecanismo aún se discute; el efecto es alerta sin mucha euforia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在没有经典兴奋剂那种多巴胺激增的情况下促进清醒。机制仍有争议；效果是警觉，而少有欣快。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在沒有經典興奮劑那種多巴胺激增的情況下促進清醒。機制仍有爭議；效果是警覺，而少有欣快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
