    "Quiet med" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Medicamento silencioso"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "静默用药"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "靜默用藥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet meds' reminders arrive silently — no buzz, no lock-screen wake. If you use iOS Scheduled Summary, they batch there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los recordatorios de los medicamentos silenciosos llegan sin sonido — sin vibración ni encender la pantalla bloqueada. Si usas el Resumen programado de iOS, se agrupan ahí."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "静默用药的提醒会无声送达——不震动，也不点亮锁定屏幕。如果你使用 iOS 的定时摘要，它们会汇总到那里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "靜默用藥的提醒會無聲送達——不震動，也不亮起鎖定畫面。如果你使用 iOS 的定時摘要，它們會彙整到那裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Racetams, choline, and cognitive aids." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Racetamos, colina y ayudas cognitivas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拉西坦类、胆碱与认知辅助剂。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拉西坦類、膽鹼與認知輔助劑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raise dopamine and noradrenaline signalling, which raises drive, attention and wakefulness — and heart rate and temperature with them. They differ mostly in how they do it: releasing the neurotransmitter, or blocking its reuptake." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aumentan la señalización de dopamina y noradrenalina, lo que eleva el impulso, la atención y la vigilia — y con ellos la frecuencia cardíaca y la temperatura. Se diferencian sobre todo en cómo lo hacen: liberando el neurotransmisor o bloqueando su recaptación."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增强多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素信号，从而提升动力、注意力和清醒度，心率和体温也随之升高。它们的差异主要在于方式：促进神经递质释放，或阻断其再摄取。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增強多巴胺和正腎上腺素訊號，從而提升動力、注意力和清醒度，心率和體溫也隨之升高。它們的差異主要在於方式：促進神經傳導物質釋放，或阻斷其再攝取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raise serotonin, noradrenaline or dopamine signalling over weeks rather than hours. The class matters here mostly for what it blocks or stacks with." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aumentan la señalización de serotonina, noradrenalina o dopamina a lo largo de semanas, no de horas. Aquí la clase importa sobre todo por lo que bloquea o con lo que se acumula."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在数周而非数小时内提升血清素、去甲肾上腺素或多巴胺信号。这一类在此主要因其阻断或叠加的对象而重要。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在數週而非數小時內提升血清素、正腎上腺素或多巴胺訊號。這一類在此主要因其阻斷或疊加的對象而重要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raise strength" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Subir concentración"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提高浓度"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提高濃度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raise volume" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Subir volumen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增加容量"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增加容量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raises noradrenaline and serotonin release by blocking the α₂ autoreceptors that normally brake it, instead of blocking reuptake. The H₁ block alongside it is the sedation and the appetite." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aumenta la liberación de noradrenalina y serotonina bloqueando los autorreceptores α₂ que normalmente la frenan, en lugar de bloquear la recaptación. El bloqueo H₁ que lo acompaña es la sedación y el apetito."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过阻断本来起刹车作用的α₂自身受体来提高去甲肾上腺素和血清素的释放，而不是阻断再摄取。与之并行的H₁阻断，就是镇静和食欲的来源。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過阻斷本來起煞車作用的α₂自身受體來提高正腎上腺素和血清素的釋放，而不是阻斷再攝取。與之並行的H₁阻斷，就是鎮靜和食慾的來源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Range" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rango"
          }
        },
