            "value" : "常规"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常規"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Regular use over weeks builds physical dependence — stopping abruptly can be dangerous even if you don't feel tolerant." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El uso regular durante semanas genera dependencia física — dejarlo de golpe puede ser peligroso aunque no notes tolerancia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连续数周规律使用会形成躯体依赖——即使你感觉不到耐受，突然停用也可能有危险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "連續數週規律使用會形成生理依賴——即使你感覺不到耐受，突然停用也可能有危險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
