          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release EC₅₀" : {
      "comment" : "Ternary basis option",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EC₅₀ de liberación"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放 EC₅₀"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放 EC₅₀"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release serotonin, along with dopamine and noradrenaline — warmth, closeness and emotional openness rather than the perceptual change of a psychedelic. Most are amphetamines with a methylenedioxy ring." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Liberan serotonina, junto con dopamina y noradrenalina — calidez, cercanía y apertura emocional en lugar del cambio perceptivo de un psicodélico. La mayoría son anfetaminas con un anillo metilendioxi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放血清素，以及多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素——带来温暖、亲近和情感开放，而非迷幻剂的知觉改变。多数是带有亚甲二氧基环的苯丙胺。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放血清素，以及多巴胺和正腎上腺素——帶來溫暖、親近和情感開放，而非迷幻劑的知覺改變。多數是帶有亞甲二氧基環的安非他命。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
