      }
    },
    "Serotonin syndrome risk — especially with DXM and other serotonergic dissociatives." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riesgo de síndrome serotoninérgico — especialmente con DXM y otros disociativos serotoninérgicos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有血清素综合征的风险——尤其是与 DXM 等血清素能解离剂。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有血清素症候群的風險——尤其是與 DXM 等血清素能解離劑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Serotonin syndrome risk — these drugs add serotonin on top of an empathogen's surge. Some (tramadol, meperidine) can also trigger seizures." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riesgo de síndrome serotoninérgico — estos fármacos añaden serotonina sobre la descarga de un empatógeno. Algunos (tramadol, meperidina) también pueden provocar convulsiones."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血清素综合征风险——这些药物会在共情剂已升高的血清素之上继续增加。部分药物（曲马多、哌替啶）还可能诱发癫痫发作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血清素症候群風險——這些藥物會在共情劑已升高的血清素之上繼續增加。部分藥物（曲馬多、哌替啶）還可能誘發癲癇發作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Serotonin syndrome risk — two serotonin-raising drugs stacked together." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riesgo de síndrome serotoninérgico — dos fármacos que elevan la serotonina combinados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血清素综合征风险——两种升高血清素的药物叠加使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血清素症候群風險——兩種升高血清素的藥物疊加使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
