    "Strong" : {
      "comment" : "Dose band",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fuerte"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "强烈"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "強烈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strong and fast: a repeat exposure soon after has much less effect. Resets within a few days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fuerte y rápida: una exposición repetida poco después tiene mucho menos efecto. Se restablece en unos días."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "又强又快：不久之后再次接触，效果会弱得多。几天内恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "又強又快：不久之後再次接觸，效果會弱得多。幾天內恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strong encryption" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cifrado fuerte"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "强加密"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "強加密"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stronger doesn't mean more dangerous — it's just how tightly the drug grips that one target in the lab." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Más fuerte no significa más peligroso — es solo la fuerza con la que la sustancia se agarra a esa diana en el laboratorio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更强并不代表更危险——它只是表示在实验室中药物与该靶点结合的紧密程度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更強並不代表更危險——它只是表示在實驗室中藥物與該靶點結合的緊密程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strongly dopaminergic (SERT-sparing)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fuertemente dopaminérgico (sin afectar SERT)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "强多巴胺能（对 SERT 作用很弱）"
