          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subcutaneous and intramuscular reach similar levels (196 vs 190 pg/mL head-to-head), so one curve serves both (Herndon 2023; Misakian 2025)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las vías subcutánea e intramuscular alcanzan niveles similares (196 frente a 190 pg/mL en comparación directa), así que una sola curva sirve para ambas (Herndon 2023; Misakian 2025)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "皮下与肌肉注射水平相近（直接对比 196 对 190 pg/mL），因此共用一条曲线（Herndon 2023；Misakian 2025）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "皮下與肌肉注射水平相近（直接對比 196 對 190 pg/mL），因此共用一條曲線（Herndon 2023；Misakian 2025）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
