    "Taken every" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se toma cada"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用药间隔"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用藥間隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking more cannabis to ease the comedown delays it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tomar más cannabis para aliviar la bajada la retrasa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为了缓解下头而补服大麻，会延后下头的时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為了緩解下頭而補服大麻，會延後下頭的時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking more in reaction to the rebound reinforces the cycle." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tomar más como reacción al rebote refuerza el ciclo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "因为反跳就再服，会强化这个循环。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "因為反跳就再服，會強化這個循環。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking more of a depressant to ease the morning symptoms delays recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tomar más de un depresor para aliviar los síntomas de la mañana retrasa la recuperación."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为了缓解早晨的不适而补服中枢抑制药，会延迟恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為了緩解早晨的不適而補服中樞抑制藥，會延遲恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking more to put off the crash delays it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tomar más para aplazar el bajón lo retrasa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为了推迟下头而补服，会延后下头的时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為了推遲下頭而補服，會延後下頭的時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking more to put off the low mood delays it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tomar más para aplazar el ánimo bajo lo retrasa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为了推迟情绪低落而补服，会延后它出现的时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為了推遲情緒低落而補服，會延後它出現的時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking more within the same session adds to what is still active." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tomar más en la misma sesión se suma a lo que sigue activo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在同一场次中再服，会叠加到仍在起效的部分上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在同一場次中再服，會疊加到仍在起效的部分上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking this daily? See where the level settles" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Lo tomas a diario? Mira dónde se estabiliza el nivel"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天服用？看看会稳定在何处"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天服用？看看會穩定在何處"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk to someone you trust — connection helps more than isolation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Habla con alguien de confianza — la conexión ayuda más que el aislamiento."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "和你信任的人聊聊——联结比孤立更有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "和你信任的人聊聊——聯結比孤立更有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap + to log your first entry." : {
