    },
    "The first label that applies is shown. When none does, the dock shows “—”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se muestra la primera etiqueta que aplique. Cuando ninguna aplica, el dock muestra “—”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示第一个适用的标签；都不适用时显示“——”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "顯示第一個適用的標籤；都不適用時顯示「——」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first prompt arrives at least %lld minutes after the dose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El primer aviso llega al menos %lld minutos después de la dosis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一条提示至少落在服用后 %lld 分钟。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一條提示至少落在服用後 %lld 分鐘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fog is reported to clear over hours. If it doesn't, seek medical help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se describe que la niebla mental se despeja en cuestión de horas. Si no ocurre, busca ayuda médica."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有人报告这种迷糊感会在数小时内消退。如果没有消退，请就医。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有人報告這種迷糊感會在數小時內消退。如果沒有消退，請就醫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The groups within it" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los grupos que contiene"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其中的分类"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其中的分類"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The highest concentration reached in the blood after a dose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La concentración más alta que alcanza la sangre tras una dosis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次用药后血液中达到的最高浓度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次用藥後血液中達到的最高濃度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The iCloud backup was merged with your data. Automatic backups are now on." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La copia de seguridad de iCloud se fusionó con tus datos. Las copias automáticas ya están activadas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud 备份已与你的数据合并。自动备份已开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud 備份已與你的資料合併。自動備份已開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The idea" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La idea"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原理"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The intestinal carrier (system-L / LAT1) saturates, so the fraction absorbed falls from ~60% at 900 mg/day to ~27% at 4800 mg/day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El transportador intestinal (system-L / LAT1) se satura, así que la fracción absorbida cae de ~60% con 900 mg/día a ~27% con 4800 mg/día."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "肠道转运体（system-L / LAT1）会饱和，吸收比例从 900 mg/天时的约 60% 降至 4800 mg/天时的约 27%。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "腸道轉運體（system-L / LAT1）會飽和，吸收比例從 900 mg/天時的約 60% 降至 4800 mg/天時的約 27%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The learned part of tolerance" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La parte aprendida de la tolerancia"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "耐受中学习来的部分"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "耐受中學習來的部分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The level in your body today, if any. First dose today." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El nivel en tu cuerpo hoy, si lo hay. Primera dosis de hoy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天体内已有的水平（如有）。第一剂在今天。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天體內已有的水平（如有）。第一劑在今天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mix adds cardiovascular strain beyond either alone, and the ethylphenidate it forms outlasts the methylphenidate itself, so the load on your heart is stretched out rather than added up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La mezcla añade una carga cardiovascular mayor que cualquiera de los dos por separado, y el etilfenidato que se forma dura más que el propio metilfenidato, así que la carga sobre tu corazón se prolonga en vez de sumarse."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这一组合对心血管的负担超过单用任一者，且生成的乙苯哌酯比哌甲酯本身更持久，因此心脏负荷被拉长而非简单叠加。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這一組合對心血管的負擔超過單用任一者，且生成的乙苯哌酯比哌甲酯本身更持久，因此心臟負荷被拉長而非簡單疊加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model combines estimated activating and sedating effects over time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El modelo combina los efectos activadores y sedantes estimados a lo largo del tiempo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型结合随时间变化的激活与镇静效应估计。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型結合隨時間變化的活化與鎮靜效應估計。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model combines estimated stimulant, serotonin and opioid effects with an adaptation term. It uses changes in modeled dopamine activity to approximate the shape of the curve." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El modelo combina los efectos estimulantes, serotoninérgicos y opioides estimados con un término de adaptación. Usa los cambios en la actividad dopaminérgica modelada para aproximar la forma de la curva."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型将估计的兴奋、血清素和阿片类效应与适应项结合，使用模拟的多巴胺活性变化近似绘制曲线。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型將估計的興奮、血清素和鴉片類效應與適應項結合，使用模擬的多巴胺活性變化近似繪製曲線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is calibrated on five stimulants: amphetamine, methylphenidate, mephedrone, 3-MMC, and 2-MMC. Other substances shape the curves through how they interact with these. Opioids are read through their dopamine activity, mostly to show those interactions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El modelo está calibrado con cinco estimulantes: anfetamina, metilfenidato, mefedrona, 3-MMC y 2-MMC. Otras sustancias dan forma a las curvas según cómo interactúan con estos. Los opioides se interpretan a través de su actividad dopaminérgica, sobre todo para mostrar esas interacciones."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该模型基于五种兴奋剂校准：苯丙胺、哌甲酯、4-甲基甲卡西酮、3-MMC 和 2-MMC。其他物质通过与它们的相互作用来影响曲线。阿片类物质则依据其多巴胺活性来解读，主要用于呈现这些相互作用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模型基於五種興奮劑校準：安非他命、哌甲酯、4-甲基甲卡西酮、3-MMC 和 2-MMC。其他物質透過與它們的交互作用來影響曲線。鴉片類物質則依據其多巴胺活性來解讀，主要用於呈現這些交互作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model puts ≈%@ %@ of your %@ %@ dose (%@) as still active — ~%lld%%" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The model puts ≈%1$@ %2$@ of your %3$@ %4$@ dose (%5$@) as still active — ~%6$lld%%"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El modelo estima que ≈%@ %@ de tu dosis de %@ %@ (%@) sigue activo — ~%lld%%"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型估计你 %3$@ %4$@ 的剂量（%5$@）中约有 ≈%1$@ %2$@ 仍在活跃——约 %6$lld%%"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型估計你 %3$@ %4$@ 的劑量（%5$@）中約有 ≈%1$@ %2$@ 仍在活躍——約 %6$lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The modeled level from now, fading over the days shown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El nivel modelado desde ahora, desvaneciéndose a lo largo de los días mostrados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从现在起的模型推算水平，在所示的天数内逐渐衰减。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "從現在起的模型推算水平，在所示的天數內逐漸衰減。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new Piru app already has your journal. Entries you add here stay in this app and won't follow, so the new one is the place to log from now on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La nueva app Piru ya tiene tu diario. Los registros que añadas aquí se quedan en esta app y no la seguirán, así que a partir de ahora la nueva es el lugar donde registrar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新的 Piru App 已经有你的日记了。在这里添加的记录只会留在这个 App 里，不会同步过去，所以从现在起，新 App 才是记录的地方。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新的 Piru App 已經有你的日記了。在這裡新增的紀錄只會留在這個 App 裡，不會同步過去，所以從現在起，新 App 才是記錄的地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The old “never mix” warning rests on little — large reviews did not find the harm it predicts. Both still strain the heart." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La vieja advertencia de “nunca mezclar” se apoya en poco — grandes revisiones no encontraron el daño que predice. Ambos siguen exigiendo al corazón."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "过去那条“绝不可混用”的警告依据很少——大型综述并未发现它所预言的危害。两者仍然都会给心脏增加负担。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "過去那條「絕不可混用」的警告依據很少——大型綜述並未發現它所預言的危害。兩者仍然都會給心臟增加負擔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The protocol below reflects community or investigational use, not validated human dosing or medical advice. Many of these compounds are WADA-prohibited and lack human safety data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El protocolo de abajo refleja uso comunitario o en investigación, no una dosificación humana validada ni consejo médico. Muchos de estos compuestos están prohibidos por la WADA y carecen de datos de seguridad en humanos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下方方案反映社区或试验性用途，并非经过验证的人体剂量或医疗建议。其中许多化合物被 WADA 禁用，且缺乏人体安全数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下方方案反映社群或試驗性用途，並非經過驗證的人體劑量或醫療建議。其中許多化合物被 WADA 禁用，且缺乏人體安全資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The quick time options in the “Now” menu when recording an entry." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las opciones rápidas de hora del menú “Ahora” al añadir un registro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加记录时“现在”菜单中的快捷时间选项。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新增記錄時「現在」選單中的快捷時間選項。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rest of the family" : {
      "comment" : "Header above the sibling drug classes",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El resto de la familia"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同类其他药物"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同類其他藥物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The share that rides along stuck to blood proteins. Only the unbound rest is free to act." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La parte que viaja pegada a las proteínas de la sangre. Solo el resto no unido queda libre para actuar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "附着在血浆蛋白上随之运行的比例。只有未结合的那部分才能发挥作用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "附著在血漿蛋白上隨之運行的比例。只有未結合的那部分才能發揮作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Shulgin Rating Scale" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La escala de valoración de Shulgin"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "舒尔金评级量表"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "舒爾金評級量表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The skin unlocks as soon as the purchase is approved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El tema se desbloquea en cuanto se aprueba la compra."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "购买获批后，皮肤会立即解锁。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "購買獲批後，皮膚會立即解鎖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SubFxOnEx effects vocabulary. Copyright © Di-lemma." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El vocabulario de efectos SubFxOnEx. Copyright © Di-lemma."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SubFxOnEx 效应词表。版权所有 © Di-lemma。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SubFxOnEx 效應詞表。版權所有 © Di-lemma。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The time for your body to clear half of what's left. It takes about five half-lives to clear almost all of it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El tiempo que tarda tu cuerpo en eliminar la mitad de lo que queda. Hacen falta unas cinco vidas medias para eliminarlo casi todo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身体清除掉其中一半所需的时间。大约经过五个半衰期才能几乎完全清除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身體清除掉其中一半所需的時間。大約經過五個半衰期才能幾乎完全清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These appear in the “When” menu when recording an entry, alongside Now and the full date picker. Swipe to remove, drag to reorder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aparecen en el menú “Cuándo” al añadir un registro, junto a Ahora y el selector de fecha completo. Desliza para quitar, arrastra para reordenar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些选项显示在添加记录时的“何时”菜单中，与“现在”和完整日期选择器并列。滑动移除，拖动排序。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些選項顯示在新增記錄時的「何時」選單中，與「現在」和完整日期選擇器並列。滑動移除，拖動排序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are population averages from research — your own values vary with genetics, body size, and how the drug is taken." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Son promedios poblacionales de la investigación — tus propios valores varían con la genética, el tamaño corporal y la forma de tomar el fármaco."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些是研究得出的群体平均值——你的实际数值会因遗传、体型以及用药方式而不同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些是研究得出的群體平均值——你的實際數值會因遺傳、體型以及用藥方式而不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These comparisons use only your own recorded days, with no control group. A difference does not establish a cause." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estas comparaciones usan solo tus propios días registrados, sin grupo de control. Una diferencia no establece una causa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些对照只使用你自己记录的日子，没有对照组。有差异不代表存在因果关系。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些對照只使用你自己記錄的日子，沒有對照組。有差異不代表存在因果關係。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These curves are built from %@. %@ sit outside the model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estas curvas se construyen a partir de %@. %@ quedan fuera del modelo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些曲线基于 %@ 构建。%@ 不在模型范围内。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些曲線基於 %@ 構建。%@ 不在模型範圍內。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These curves illustrate model assumptions. They do not measure your feelings, energy, impairment or physical safety. Individual responses and combinations may differ substantially." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estas curvas ilustran supuestos del modelo. No miden tus sensaciones, tu energía, tu deterioro ni tu seguridad física. Las respuestas individuales y las combinaciones pueden diferir sustancialmente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些曲线用于展示模型假设，并不测量你的感受、精力、功能受损程度或身体安全状况。个体反应和组合效应可能有很大差异。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些曲線用於展示模型假設，並不測量你的感受、精力、功能受損程度或身體安全狀況。個體反應和組合效應可能有很大差異。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These notes will appear at the end of the PDF report." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estas notas aparecerán al final del informe PDF."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些备注将出现在 PDF 报告末尾。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些備註將出現在 PDF 報告末尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These values were not measured together — each is its own study. Ranked here for scale." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estos valores no se midieron juntos — cada uno es su propio estudio. Se ordenan aquí para dar escala."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些数值并非在同一实验中测得——每个都来自各自的研究。此处排列只为呈现量级。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些數值並非在同一實驗中測得——每個都來自各自的研究。此處排列只為呈現量級。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Things feeling 'weird' for a while is commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se reporta a menudo que las cosas se sienten 'raras' durante un rato."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常有人会有一段时间觉得“怪怪的”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常有人會有一段時間覺得「怪怪的」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Apple Account has no Piru purchases." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta cuenta de Apple no tiene compras de Piru."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 Apple 账户没有 Piru 的购买记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 Apple 帳號沒有 Piru 的購買記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This backup uses a newer format (v%lld) than this version of Piru understands. Please update the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta copia de seguridad usa un formato más nuevo (v%lld) del que entiende esta versión de Piru. Actualiza la app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此备份使用的格式（v%lld）比当前 Piru 版本更新。请更新应用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此備份使用的格式（v%lld）比目前 Piru 版本更新。請更新 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can entrench a deeper change that takes months to relax. It shows up only well past everyday or therapeutic doses — steady use doesn't reach it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto puede afianzar un cambio más profundo que tarda meses en relajarse. Solo aparece muy por encima de las dosis cotidianas o terapéuticas — el uso estable no llega a él."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会留下一种更深的变化，要好几个月才松得下来。它只在远超日常或治疗剂量时才出现——持续稳定地用也碰不到它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這會留下一種更深的變化，要好幾個月才鬆得下來。它只在遠超日常或治療劑量時才出現——持續穩定地用也碰不到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This class can block the signal to the bladder. Not being able to pass urine at all is a reason to get help now rather than wait for the timeline." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta clase puede bloquear la señal hacia la vejiga. No poder orinar en absoluto es motivo para buscar ayuda ahora, en vez de esperar a la línea de tiempo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该类药物可能阻断通往膀胱的信号。完全排不出尿，应当立刻求助，而不是等时间线走完。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該類藥物可能阻斷通往膀胱的訊號。完全排不出尿，應當立刻求助，而不是等時間軸走完。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This class can stop memories forming while it is active. What you write down now is the record." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta clase puede impedir que se formen recuerdos mientras está activa. Lo que escribas ahora es el registro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这一类在起效期间可能阻止记忆形成。你现在写下的就是记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這一類在起效期間可能阻止記憶形成。你現在寫下的就是記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This class raises body temperature. Feeling very hot, confused or rigid is an emergency — cool down and call for help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta clase eleva la temperatura corporal. Sentir mucho calor, confusión o rigidez es una emergencia — refréscate y pide ayuda."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这一类会升高体温。感觉非常热、意识混乱或肌肉僵直属于急症——降温并呼叫救助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這一類會升高體溫。感覺非常熱、意識混亂或肌肉僵直屬於急症——降溫並呼叫救助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This compound has no validated human dose data. Information below is for reference only — see the linked sources for primary literature. Do not extrapolate doses from related compounds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este compuesto no tiene datos validados de dosis en humanos. La información de abajo es solo de referencia — consulta las fuentes enlazadas para la literatura primaria. No extrapoles dosis de compuestos relacionados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该化合物没有经过验证的人体剂量数据。以下信息仅供参考——原始文献请参阅所链接的来源。请勿根据相关化合物推算剂量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該化合物沒有經過驗證的人體劑量資料。以下資訊僅供參考——原始文獻請參閱所連結的來源。請勿根據相關化合物推算劑量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This curve reaches the heavy dose range" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta curva alcanza el rango de dosis alta"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此曲线达到大剂量区间"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此曲線達到大劑量區間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes your journal, profile, schedules, inventory, custom presets and local recovery copies. Your Watch clears its copy when it reconnects. Exported files, Apple Health records and device backups are not affected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto elimina tu diario, perfil, horarios, inventario, preajustes personalizados y copias locales de recuperación. Tu Watch borra su copia cuando se reconecte. Los archivos exportados, los registros de Apple Salud y las copias de seguridad del dispositivo no se ven afectados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会删除日志、个人资料、计划、库存、自定义预设和本地恢复副本。Watch 会在重新连接后清除其副本。已导出的文件、Apple 健康记录和设备备份不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這會刪除日誌、個人資料、排程、庫存、自訂預設和本機復原副本。Watch 會在重新連線後清除其副本。已匯出的檔案、Apple 健康記錄和裝置備份不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device's backup key isn't available yet. If you just signed in, give iCloud Keychain a moment to sync." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clave de copia de seguridad de este dispositivo aún no está disponible. Si acabas de iniciar sesión, dale un momento al llavero de iCloud para sincronizarse."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备的备份密钥尚不可用。如果你刚刚登录，请稍候让 iCloud 钥匙串完成同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此裝置的備份金鑰尚無法使用。若你剛登入，請稍候讓 iCloud 鑰匙圈完成同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is too large to be a Piru backup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo es demasiado grande para ser una copia de seguridad de Piru."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此文件太大，不是有效的 Piru 备份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此檔案太大，不是有效的 Piru 備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file isn't a Piru export or a PsychonautWiki journal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
