          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is an encrypted Piru backup. Use Restore Encrypted Backup and enter its passphrase." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta es una copia de seguridad cifrada de Piru. Usa Restaurar copia cifrada e introduce su frase de contraseña."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是加密的 Piru 备份。请使用“恢复加密备份”并输入其密码短语。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是加密的 Piru 備份。請使用「還原加密備份」並輸入其密碼短語。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the only session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta es la única sesión."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是唯一的场次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是唯一的場次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This metabolite (HNK) barely touches the NMDA receptor ketamine acts on — it's studied for a separate, non-dissociative antidepressant effect, so it isn't simply ketamine continuing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este metabolito (HNK) apenas toca el receptor NMDA sobre el que actúa la ketamina — se estudia por un efecto antidepresivo separado, no disociativo, así que no es simplemente la ketamina continuando."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这种代谢物（HNK）几乎不作用于氯胺酮所靶向的 NMDA 受体——它被研究的是一种独立的、非解离性的抗抑郁效应，因此并非氯胺酮效果的简单延续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這種代謝物（HNK）幾乎不作用於氯胺酮所靶向的 NMDA 受體——它被研究的是一種獨立的、非解離性的抗憂鬱效應，因此並非氯胺酮效果的簡單延續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This month's adherence calendar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calendario de adherencia de este mes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本月依从性日历"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本月依從性日曆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This period" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este periodo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本期"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This replaces your current data with the %@ in this copy. A snapshot of your current data is taken first, so it's reversible. Restart Piru afterwards to load it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto reemplaza tus datos actuales con los %@ de esta copia. Primero se toma una instantánea de tus datos actuales, así que es reversible. Reinicia Piru después para cargarla."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将用此副本中的 %@ 替换你当前的数据。替换前会先为当前数据创建快照，因此可以撤销。之后请重新启动 Piru 以加载。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這會用此副本中的 %@ 取代你目前的資料。取代前會先為目前資料建立快照，因此可以復原。之後請重新啟動 Piru 以載入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This session logs %@, which sit outside the model, so these curves stay empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta sesión registra %@, que quedan fuera del modelo, así que estas curvas se quedan vacías."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本场包含 %@，它们不在模型范围内，因此这些曲线为空。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本場包含 %@，它們不在模型範圍內，因此這些曲線為空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This substance already has a \"%@\" unit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta sustancia ya tiene una unidad \"%@\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该物质已有“%@”单位。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此物質已有「%@」單位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This substance's mechanism of action may involve multiple pharmacological targets or may not be fully characterized. Consult specific pharmacological references for detailed mechanistic information." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El mecanismo de acción de esta sustancia puede implicar múltiples dianas farmacológicas o no estar del todo caracterizado. Consulta referencias farmacológicas específicas para información mecanística detallada."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此物质的作用机制可能涉及多个药理靶点，或尚未完全表征。请参阅具体的药理学参考资料以获取详细的机制信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此物質的作用機制可能涉及多個藥理靶點，或尚未完全表徵。請參閱具體的藥理學參考資料以獲取詳細的機制資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This unusual Phase II conjugate retains the nor-mephedrone core — whether it has pharmacological activity is unknown, but its long plasma half-life means it lingers well past mephedrone's short duration." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este conjugado de fase II poco habitual conserva el núcleo de nor-mefedrona — se desconoce si tiene actividad farmacológica, pero su larga vida media plasmática hace que persista mucho más allá de la corta duración de la mefedrona."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这种不寻常的 II 相结合物保留了去甲甲卡西酮的核心结构——是否具有药理活性尚不明确，但其较长的血浆半衰期意味着它在甲卡西酮的短暂作用期过后仍会存留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這種不尋常的 II 相結合物保留了去甲甲卡西酮的核心結構——是否具有藥理活性尚不明確，但其較長的血漿半衰期意味著它在甲卡西酮的短暫作用期過後仍會存留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
