            "value" : "耐受性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tolerance" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tolerancia"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "耐受性"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "耐受性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tolerance drops quickly after a break. A dose you handled before is the documented cause of many overdoses." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La tolerancia cae rápido tras una pausa. Una dosis que antes manejabas es la causa documentada de muchas sobredosis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停用一段时间后耐受会迅速下降。以前承受得住的剂量，是许多过量事件有文献记录的原因。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停用一段時間後耐受會迅速下降。以前承受得住的劑量，是許多過量事件有文獻記錄的原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tolerance is shared by receptor, not by name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La tolerancia se comparte por receptor, no por nombre"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "耐受按受体共享，而非按名称"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "耐受按受體共享，而非按名稱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tolerance plus physical dependence; stopping abruptly after heavy regular use can be dangerous." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tolerancia más dependencia física; dejarlo de golpe tras un uso regular intenso puede ser peligroso."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "既有耐受，也有躯体依赖；长期大量规律使用后突然停用可能有危险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "既有耐受，也有生理依賴；長期大量規律使用後突然停用可能有危險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tolerance to amphetamine's appetite suppression does not build at all unless food is available while intoxicated — the tolerance is an instrumental response, not a receptor count (Carlton & Wolgin 1971). This means tolerance to one effect of a drug can exist while tolerance to another has never started." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La tolerancia a la supresión del apetito de la anfetamina no se desarrolla en absoluto a menos que haya comida disponible mientras estás bajo sus efectos — la tolerancia es una respuesta instrumental, no un recuento de receptores (Carlton & Wolgin 1971). Esto significa que puede existir tolerancia a un efecto de una sustancia mientras la tolerancia a otro nunca ha empezado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯丙胺对食欲的抑制，除非在药效期间有食物可吃，否则根本不会形成耐受——这种耐受是一种工具性反应，不是受体数量问题（Carlton & Wolgin 1971）。这意味着对一种药的某个效果可以有耐受，而对另一个效果的耐受可能从未开始。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安非他命對食慾的抑制，除非在藥效期間有食物可吃，否則根本不會形成耐受——這種耐受是一種工具性反應，不是受體數量問題（Carlton & Wolgin 1971）。這意味著對一種藥的某個效果可以有耐受，而對另一個效果的耐受可能從未開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too short — use at least %lld characters." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Demasiado corta — usa al menos %lld caracteres."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太短了——请至少使用 %lld 个字符。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太短了——請至少使用 %lld 個字元。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
