            "value" : "最多 %lld 個字元。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up to %lld prompts, from %lld minutes to 24 hours after the dose. The suggested times come from the modeled phases of what you logged. Each one opens a timestamped note; none of them is required." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Up to %1$lld prompts, from %2$lld minutes to 24 hours after the dose. The suggested times come from the modeled phases of what you logged. Each one opens a timestamped note; none of them is required."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasta %lld avisos, desde %lld minutos hasta 24 horas después de la dosis. Los horarios sugeridos vienen de las fases modeladas de lo que registraste. Cada uno abre una nota con marca de tiempo; ninguno es obligatorio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最多 %lld 条提示，落在服用后 %lld 分钟到 24 小时之间。建议的时间来自你所记录物质的各阶段模型。每条都会打开一则带时间戳的笔记；没有一条是必须的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最多 %lld 條提示，落在服用後 %lld 分鐘到 24 小時之間。建議的時間來自你所記錄物質的各階段模型。每條都會打開一則帶時間戳的筆記；沒有一條是必須的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
