    "With daily phenibut or F-phenibut, dependence develops within weeks and withdrawal can be protracted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con fenibut o F-fenibut a diario, la dependencia se desarrolla en semanas y la abstinencia puede ser prolongada."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每日使用苯尼布特或 F-苯尼布特，数周内就会形成依赖，戒断可能迁延很久。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每日使用苯尼布特或 F-苯尼布特，數週內就會形成依賴，戒斷可能遷延很久。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
