    "You are not alone. People care about you and help is available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No estás solo ni sola. Hay gente a la que le importas y hay ayuda disponible."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你并不孤单。有人关心你，也有可用的帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你並不孤單。有人關心你，也有可用的幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't have to do this alone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No tienes que pasar por esto a solas"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你不必独自面对"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你不必獨自面對"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't have to do this alone. Help is one tap away." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No tienes que pasar por esto a solas. La ayuda está a un toque."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你不必独自面对。帮助只需轻点一下。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你不必獨自面對。協助只需輕點一下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have %lld substances with colors from before. Move them to class colors, or keep them exactly as they are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tienes %lld sustancias con colores de antes. Pásalas a colores de clase o déjalas exactamente como están."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你有 %lld 种物质沿用着之前的颜色。可以将它们改为类别颜色，也可以原样保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你有 %lld 種物質沿用著之前的顏色。可以將它們改為類別顏色，也可以原樣保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You may need food and rest after several hours without them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede que necesites comer y descansar tras varias horas sin hacerlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果已经几个小时没吃东西或休息，你可能需要补充食物和休息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果已經幾個小時沒吃東西或休息，你可能需要補充食物和休息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You may think differently about important decisions and emotionally charged messages tomorrow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mañana quizá veas de otra forma las decisiones importantes y los mensajes con carga emocional."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "到明天，你对重要决定和带有情绪的消息可能会有不同看法。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "到明天，你對重要決定和帶有情緒的訊息可能會有不同看法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
