    "Your measured testosterone. On estradiol, T usually falls; Piru plots your points rather than modeling suppression." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu testosterona medida. Con estradiol, la T suele bajar; Piru traza tus puntos en lugar de modelar la supresión."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你实测的睾酮。用雌二醇期间 T 通常会下降；Piru 绘制你的数据点，而不是对抑制建模。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你實測的睪固酮。用雌二醇期間 T 通常會下降；Piru 繪製你的資料點，而不是對抑制建模。"
